  "description": "The most powerful secret society in martial arts history, the Ten-Character Alliance, secretly organized to overthrow the legendary Baekgeomhoe (百劍會) and seize supremacy over the world! Cheongpung, a superhuman raised to counter their formidable power! Will he be able to destroy the Ten-Character Alliance, his lifelong dream, and master the true art of the sword? A surprising truth unfolds before Cheongpung, who cuts through the endless whirlpool of conspiracy and betrayal like a dagger! The turbulent life of the great swordsman Cheongpung, who clad in black armor and wielding a rusty iron sword, unfolds with a bang! Now he will pacify your heart, too. An early masterpiece of the Yong Dae-Un martial arts!!!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
